menu "Warthog halow_mesh_compat (Linux driver port)"

config WARTHOG_MESH_COMPAT
    bool "Enable Linux morse_driver port for mesh"
    default n
    help
      Enables the Linux GPL morse_driver compatibility layer that provides
      mesh-capable host-side driving of the MM6108 chip. Gated by default
      because:
        - License (GPL-2.0+) propagates to the firmware binary
        - Currently scaffold-only; needs Morse Micro to deliver a
          mesh-capable MMFW firmware before the port can complete
      See components/halow_mesh_compat/README.md for status.

config WARTHOG_MESH_COMPAT_DEBUG
    bool "Verbose logging in mesh compat layer"
    depends on WARTHOG_MESH_COMPAT
    default n
    help
      Routes the ported driver's pr_debug / dot11ah_dbg / MORSE_INFO
      logging through ESP_LOGI. Voluminous; only enable for bring-up.

endmenu
